It is Thursday evening, and I usually play badminton.
But I feel bad, so I have to cancel.
I write a message to my badminton partner.
I explain that I am sick and that my head hurts.
My throat also still hurts a lot.
I ought to just relax on the sofa tonight.
I pull a warm blanket over myself.
I take my new medicine from the pharmacy.
Afterwards, I make a large cup of hot tea.
I put a large spoonful of honey in the tea.
It feels really good in my sore throat.
I drink the hot tea very slowly.
Soon I feel a little better.
So I close them and listen to calm music.
I do not feel completely well yet.
But fortunately I already feel a little better.
I ought to go to bed early and sleep.
